.TH EXTRACT 1 "April 2026" "pack-extract 1.5.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
extract \- automatically extract compressed archives
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B extract
.RB [ \-v | \-\-version ]
.br
.B extract
.RB [ \-h | \-\-help ]
.br
.B extract
.I archive
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B extract
detects the format of a compressed archive using MIME type detection
and extracts its contents into the current directory. After extraction,
it prints the list of newly created files and directories.
.PP
Format detection is automatic via
.BR file (1)
so the user does not need to remember tool-specific flags.
.PP
This version is rewritten in C for improved performance compared to the original bash implementation.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-version
Display version information and exit.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Display help message and exit.
.SH SUPPORTED FORMATS
.TS
l l l.
Format	MIME type	Tool used
_
\&.tar	application/x-tar	tar
\&.tar.gz, .tgz	application/gzip	tar
\&.tar.xz, .txz	application/x-xz	tar
\&.tar.bz2, .tbz2	application/x-bzip2	tar
\&.tar.zst, .tzst	application/zstd	tar \-\-zstd
\&.tar.lz4, .tlz4	application/x-lz4	tar + lz4
\&.tar.lz	application/x-lzip	tar \-\-lzip
\&.tar.lzo, .tlzo	application/x-lzop	tar + lzop
\&.tar.br, .tbr	application/x-brotli	tar + brotli
\&.gz	application/gzip	gunzip
\&.xz	application/x-xz	unxz
\&.bz2	application/x-bzip2	bunzip2
\&.zst	application/zstd	zstd
\&.lz4	application/x-lz4	lz4
\&.lzo	application/x-lzop	lzop
\&.br	application/x-brotli	brotli
\&.zip	application/zip	unzip
\&.7z	application/x-7z-compressed	7z
\&.rar	application/x-rar-compressed	unrar
\&.cpio	application/x-cpio	cpio
.TE
.PP
For gzip, xz, bzip2, zstd, lz4, lzop, and brotli, the tool distinguishes between
tar archives (e.g.\& .tar.gz) and plain compressed files (e.g.\& .gz)
by inspecting the file extension.
.SH EXAMPLES
Extract a gzip-compressed tarball:
.PP
.RS
.nf
$ extract backup.tar.gz
.fi
.RE
.PP
Extract a zip file:
.PP
.RS
.nf
$ extract project.zip
.fi
.RE
.PP
Extract a 7z archive:
.PP
.RS
.nf
$ extract data.7z
.fi
.RE
.PP
Decompress a single gzip file:
.PP
.RS
.nf
$ extract notes.txt.gz
.fi
.RE
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Successful extraction.
.TP
.B 1
An error occurred (file not found, unsupported format, extraction failure).
.SH DEPENDENCIES
.B extract
relies on standard system utilities. Not all need to be installed;
only those for the formats you use:
.BR tar (1),
.BR gunzip (1),
.BR unxz (1),
.BR bunzip2 (1),
.BR zstd (1),
.BR lz4 (1),
.BR lzip (1),
.BR lzop (1),
.BR brotli (1),
.BR unzip (1),
.BR 7z (1),
.BR unrar (1),
.BR cpio (1),
.BR file (1).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pack (1),
.BR tar (1),
.BR gzip (1),
.BR zip (1),
.BR 7z (1)
